**Turn 1**: `«مشخصات خودرو با پلاک ۱۲الف۳۴۵ رو بده»`

| Step | What happens |
|---|---|
| `queryBuilder.build()` | 34 chars, no continuation prefix → not a follow-up → returns message as-is |
| `router.route()` | scores 0.86 against VEHICLE examples → `VEHICLE` |
| `intentCache.remember()` | caches `session → VEHICLE` |
| `chatClient` | gets only `VehicleTools`, calls `getVehicle("12ALF345")`, streams answer |
| memory advisor | saves user + assistant messages *after* completion |

**Turn 2**: `«و جریمه‌هاش؟»`

| Step | What happens |
|---|---|
| `queryBuilder.build()` | 12 chars + starts with «و » → follow-up → finds last user msg in memory → returns `«مشخصات خودرو با پلاک ۱۲الف۳۴۵ رو بده — و جریمه‌هاش؟»` |
| `router.route()` | enriched query scores high on VEHICLE → `VEHICLE` (sticky not even needed) |
| `chatClient` | receives **original** «و جریمه‌هاش؟» + history via advisor → model resolves «هاش» → calls `getVehicleFines("12ALF345")` |

## 5. Tests for the wiring itself

`RoutingQueryBuilder` is pure logic + a `ChatMemory` read — unit test it without any LLM:

```java
@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)
class RoutingQueryBuilderTest {

    @Mock ChatMemory chatMemory;
    @InjectMocks RoutingQueryBuilder builder;

    @Test
    void standaloneMessage_returnedAsIs() {
        String result = builder.build("s1", "مشخصات خودرو با پلاک ۱۲الف۳۴۵ رو بده");
        assertThat(result).doesNotContain("—");
        verifyNoInteractions(chatMemory);              // no memory read for standalone
    }

    @Test
    void shortFollowUp_enrichedWithPreviousUserMessage() {
        when(chatMemory.get("s1")).thenReturn(List.of(
                new UserMessage("مشخصات خودرو با پلاک ۱۲الف۳۴۵ رو بده"),
                new AssistantMessage("خودروی شما پژو ۲۰۶ است")));

        String result = builder.build("s1", "و جریمه‌هاش؟");

        assertThat(result).contains("پلاک").contains("جریمه‌هاش");
    }

    @Test
    void followUpWithEmptyHistory_returnsMessageUnchanged() {
        when(chatMemory.get("s1")).thenReturn(List.of());
        assertThat(builder.build("s1", "و جریمه‌هاش؟")).isEqualTo("و جریمه‌هاش؟");
    }
}
```

